{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56592","headline":"春日题感上人山庄简法友 · 惠敏","name":"春日题感上人山庄简法友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾友幽栖地，今来艺黍南。\n阶生王子竹，庭结负山庵。\n花叶裁新□，樵舟泊小潭。\n相传此爲胜，诗迟坐中探。\n（日本藏唐抄本《新撰类林抄》卷四。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"惠敏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}